# render-card demo — the table-of-contents card.
name: render-toc
title: What the document holds
theme: rounded
description: |
  `semtext toc demo/auth-notes.sem.html` numbers every section and
  subsection, then lists diagrams, charts and tables with their
  captions:

    Diagram flow: The auth flow
    Table apple: GDP By Region

  A listing's reference is the element id when the document sets one,
  else the per-kind ordinal (Diagram 1, Diagram 2, ...).
